Upstream-Name: MoinMoin
Upstream-Contact: https://moinmo.in/
Source: https://static.moinmo.in/files/moin-1.9.11.tar.gz
Comment: MoinMoin 1.12.0 (moinmoin-py3-md,
 https://github.com/asbestomolesto/moinmoin-py3-md) is MoinMoin 1.9.11
 ported to Python 3, with Markdown pages, by
 Gabriele 'asbesto' Zaverio with the assistance of Claude (Anthropic AI);
 the files written or modified by Claude are marked with a comment at their
 top, the details are in docs/CHANGES and in the git history. The bundled copies of
 pygments, passlib and parsedatetime were removed (the Debian packages
 are used); flup was replaced by flup 1.0.3 (Python 3 version).
 More license texts are in docs/licenses/ of the source.

